msgstr ""

msgid "``~/.s3dgraphy/plugins-data/<id>/`` — the plugin's own state, out of the document, kept across updates (§14.3). Made when asked."
msgstr ""

msgid "Wire a DECLARED command: ``fn(slots) -> value``. A command not declared in the manifest is refused (a menu entry is a promise of the manifest, not of the code). Usable as a decorator."
msgstr ""

msgid "Listen to an event of every document (slot ``event@1``). The listener writes AS the plugin: a write it opens runs after the delivery."
msgstr ""

