msgstr ""

msgid "G-5 (MICRO-GEO02) · stamp a file this plugin made, in one line: ``<artifact>.stamp.json`` beside it, the plugin as the agent (id and version). ``inputs``, ``parameters``, ``dtc_kind``, ``technique``…: :func:`s3dgraphy.em.stamps.stamp_artifact`. Encouraged, never required."
msgstr ""

msgid "The plugin (and command) on whose behalf ``em`` is acting now (see :func:`calling_now`)."
msgstr ""

